<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIAN C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 11/12.</title>
<headline>ESTONIAN C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 11/12.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Monday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for August 11/12. The kroon is</p>
<p>pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	     August 11/12   August 8-11</p>
<p>    CZK     0.43509	 0.43482</p>
<p>    DKK     2.10008	 2.09993</p>
<p>    FIM     2.67589	 2.67388</p>
<p>    GBP    23.58668	23.84775</p>
<p>    HUF     0.07478	 0.07496</p>
<p>    LTL     3.71164	 3.74394</p>
<p>    LVL    25.32776	25.29135</p>
<p>    RUR     0.00356	 0.00258</p>
<p>    SEK     1.86328	 1.85856</p>
<p>    UAH     8.00647	 8.07809</p>
<p>    USD    14.8484	 14.9788</p>
<p>    XEU    15.73188	15.71426</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
